<title>USA: TABLE - Styling Technology Corp Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Styling Technology Corp Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>STYLING TECHNOLOGY CORPORATION</p>
<p>				  OPERATING HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except earnings per share)</p>
<p>INCOME STATEMENT INFORMATION:</p>
<p>						 3 Mos End    6 Mos Ended</p>
